// Queries run against SentinelHealth in run bower-sentinel-20261103-054834.
//
// 1. Evidence collection: produced sentinel-health.json (run at about 09:22 UTC, timespan P1D).
//    This is not the guide's alert query: it keeps Success rows, has no "Bower:" name filter
//    (every analytics rule in the workspace was a Bower rule or the Bower probe) and adds
//    WindowStart, Results, Alerts, TotalCpu and DataUsed. The guide's query applied to these
//    rows is the 25 rows with Status != "Success".
SentinelHealth
| where SentinelResourceType == "Analytics Rule"
| extend P = todynamic(ExtendedProperties)
| project TimeGenerated, SentinelResourceName, Status, Reason, Issue = tostring(P.Issues[0].Code),
    WindowStart = todatetime(P.QueryStartTimeUTC), WindowEnd = todatetime(P.QueryEndTimeUTC), Results = toint(P.QueryResultAmount),
    Alerts = toint(P.AlertsGeneratedAmount), TotalCpu = tostring(P.QueryPerformanceIndicators.TotalCpu),
    DataUsed = tolong(P.QueryPerformanceIndicators.DataUsedForQueryProcessing)
| order by SentinelResourceName asc, WindowEnd asc

// 2. The previous guide query, run as published at about 08:20 UTC (timespan P1D): it returned
//    the 11 failure rows that had arrived by then, every one with an empty Reason, because
//    ExtendedProperties has no Reason key.
SentinelHealth
| where SentinelResourceType == "Analytics Rule" and SentinelResourceName startswith "Bower:"
| where Status != "Success"
| project TimeGenerated, SentinelResourceName, Status, Description, Reason = tostring(ExtendedProperties.Reason)

// 3. The corrected guide query as run at about 08:21 UTC (timespan P1D): the same 11 rows, with
//    Reason, Issue (QueryGeneralError for the three first runs, ReferencedTableNotFound for the
//    probe) and WindowEnd. Its output was read in the session, not saved. The guide adds
//    a closed ingestion slot, `| where ingestion_time() > ago(15m) and ingestion_time() <= now()`,
//    for use as a scheduled rule (after review; first published as `> ago(15m)` only). That line
//    was not run live (it returns only rows ingested in the 15 minutes before the query).
SentinelHealth
| where SentinelResourceType == "Analytics Rule" and SentinelResourceName startswith "Bower:"
| where Status != "Success"
| project TimeGenerated, SentinelResourceName, Status, Reason, Issue = tostring(ExtendedProperties.Issues[0].Code),
    WindowEnd = todatetime(ExtendedProperties.QueryEndTimeUTC)
